 874:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4_frag.c **** 
 875:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4_frag.c ****     /* Unfortunately we can't reuse rambuf - the hardware may still be
 876:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4_frag.c ****      * using the buffer. Instead we free it (and the ensuing chain) and
 877:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/ip4_frag.c ****      * recreate it next time round the loop. If we're lucky the hardware
